---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";

const meta = {
	title: "About",
	description: "Computer engineer focused on blockchain engineering and Rust.",
};
---

<PageLayout meta={meta}>
	<h1 class="title mb-12">About</h1>
	<div class="prose prose-sm prose-cactus max-w-none">
		<p>Hi, I’m a computer engineer. I’ve worked across various domains and tech stacks over the years.</p>
		<p>Right now, my main focus is:</p>
		<ul class="list-inside list-disc" role="list">
			<li>⛓️ Blockchain engineering</li>
			<li>🦀 Rust</li>
		</ul>
		<p>
			This blog is a collection of field notes rather than long tutorials. I write mostly as notes for my
			future self, hopefully it's useful to others too!
		</p>
	</div>
</PageLayout>
